{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45114","headline":"题报恩寺惟照上人房 · 皎然","name":"题报恩寺惟照上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上界雨色乾，凉宫日迟迟。\n水文披菡萏，山翠动罘罳。\n中有清真子，愔愔步闲墀。\n手萦颇黎缕，愿证黄金姿。\n旋草堦下生，看心当此时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}